# Filing Momentum ML production research data -- never committed: raw
# provider payloads, normalized records, feature/model/regime caches,
# dataset manifests, generated reports, and notebook run outputs.
# Trailing-glob form (not just the bare directory): one-off acquisition
# runs land in dated sibling dirs like
# `data/raw/filing_momentum_ml_split_adj_div_unadj_20260813/`, which an
# exact-directory rule does not cover -- a `git add -A` then stages
# gigabytes of raw provider payloads. Same reason for the other data/
# rules below.
data/raw/filing_momentum_ml*
data/normalized/filing_momentum_ml*
data/cache/filing_momentum_ml*
data/manifests/filing_momentum_ml*
outputs/reports/
research/strategies/filing_momentum_ml/outputs/

# Persisted model store (fitted estimators, keyed by ModelIdentity) and
# the write-once live decision log -- also never committed.
data/models/filing_momentum_ml*
data/decisions/filing_momentum_ml*

# Paper-trading sleeve ledger and order-run audit log -- also never
# committed; both hold live broker-account state.
data/ledger/
data/orders/filing_momentum_ml*

# Scheduled-job output (nightly data-refresh check, daily paper-trade run).
data/logs/filing_momentum_ml*

# Multi-Factor Ranking ML -- same categories of never-committed
# production/research data, mirrored under its own strategy name.
data/raw/multi_factor_ranking_ml*
data/normalized/multi_factor_ranking_ml*
data/cache/multi_factor_ranking_ml*
data/manifests/multi_factor_ranking_ml*
research/strategies/multi_factor_ranking_ml/outputs/
data/models/multi_factor_ranking_ml*
data/decisions/multi_factor_ranking_ml*
data/orders/multi_factor_ranking_ml*
data/logs/multi_factor_ranking_ml*
